  "prefLabel": "Env-C 202.11 Participant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 202.11 “Participant” means:\n\n(a) For an adjudicative proceeding, a respondent, intervenor, or representative of the department for that adjudicative proceeding; or\n\n(b) For a non-adjudicative proceeding, any person who attends the hearing or submits comments in writing on paper or by e-mail, or both.\n\nSource. #8851-A, eff 3-25-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
